        "text": "To make this spelling joke work in Japanese, the translator first gave the line a literal translation. Because this pushed the \"(r money\") part to the middle of the sentence instead of the end, the localization programmer then modified the game to display \"(r money)\" in its own tiny font. The result looks different from the original English line, but achieves a similar, comical effect.",
